finding The completed R0/R1/R2 owner is a CPU authority with no production or FireSequenceTest call site.
finding AttemptFireProductionCompatibleMomentumDiagnosticMetal only scopes CompatibleMomentumDiagnosticActive around AttemptFireProductionResidentStepMetal.
finding The r182 compatible consumer and r183 tokenless single-stage diagnostic are historically rejected substitutes and cannot authorize the three-way port verdict.
finding The existing onset CLI defaults to the r182 compatible diagnostic and therefore is not the requested completed-port leg.
finding The r181 tier-8 stability premise extrapolated a healthy 1.8264868_s prefix beyond its measured horizon.
finding The historical 63.339610872283018_kg_per_m2_s2 value is a velocity-owning-face sample at oracle time 2.1135824235796083_s, not an equal-time criterion.
finding The nearest-retained-time oracle fixed-column maximum is 159.00892323854879_kg_per_m2_s2 at 2.1079791976176079_s versus production time 2.1077302111661993_s; their authored-decimal separation is 0.0002489864514086_s.

